Chapter 12 Temperature Sensor > Project 12.1 Detect the Temperature

We will use a thermistor to detect the ambient temperature.

Chapter 12 Temperature Sensor > Project 12.1 Detect the Temperature > Component List

Control board x1

Breadboard x1

USB cable x1

Thermistor x1

